    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweedajeega badayda habeawajeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu goobalool Musa fuga hees bea eemoojiga fuga Israeli, ak gwayeesha, “Nih ng'asheanda rugu NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida iirasa gida NG'UTAMIIDA, ghana iiyaak habeawooda jea ghwanung'waadawa gida, ea adagwanuus gidida heeleesean, gagasa gwasinda ng'asheega sean gidarukuteayda aba ghuutaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gatmooda iirasa gida NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gooluulda geaw, aba neajeeda, nea gudugwanda gheaghwaan aba huduumeadaanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwayiiy ghwaan gideaba nirat gida, ea gidaluuldeayda geaw, ak ghwasiinda ghwaan; abeeda gaygamajeegiit haleanjeeda rat, abeeda gilinyoo ghwarat gaygamajeegiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama deepa ghaheawa ghwaan eaweedida iinyaan; was habeawajeagaaschi abeeda ea maygwanda habeawooda badaydaanyi, abeeda ea manda habeawooda jea ghwarat niny, ak gwasa; ak gaygwasamsa NG'UTAMIIDA niny, aba gideaba ghaheawa ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama deepa ea sighi, aba damani aga habeawajeagaaschiin, ghana aba ng'asheanda rukuna ghuutaanyi nea meateemshi nea gwanda jeeda radoodean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwayiiy siyeadaanyi, ak gwasiindeaysa eaweedida iinya ng'asheanjiin; abeeda gaygamajeegiit haleanjeeda rat gaygamajeegiit, ak haleanjeadaanyi rat gaygamajeekcheewiidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama deepa ghaheawa siyeadaanyi eaweedida iinyaan; abeeda gaygwanuus habeawooni itaanyi mida badaydaanyiin nea ng'asheanda rukuna ghuutaanyi nea meateemshi, was dea rada geawiin; abeeda gaygwasamsa NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea habeawooda masiinung'weanda ghana dea gatmooda sinung', gida wassean deepa ghwarada geaw, gaygamajeegiit aba badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ak habeawooda nea gwanda gheesiyeadaanyi, ghana gwadeepa ghwarat geaw nea ghwaak habeawooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwayiiy siyeadaanyi ak ea marukusiina gil, nea mwaheawana; abeeda habeawajeagaaschi sean gaygamajeegiit, nea eara radooda rat geaw gaygamajeegiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama yam siyeadaanyi ak ghwanung' ghoah ng'asheega mwadaagha eaweeda iinya ng'asheesu, abeeda ng'asheega sean rinna ghuutaanyi aba habeawajeagaaschi, ghana gidida rada geawiin, abeeda ea maygamajeegiit; ak gaygwasamsa NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gili wassean sirat, ea giliwas habeawooda iradi jea gwasawanyi, gaygoomajeek siyeadaanyi, ghana ghwanung' gaba mwadaagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama siindeaysa siyeeda gatmoadaanyi muuchi aba giliwas eaweecha; abeeda goomajeek habeawajeagaaschi sean, ghana haleanjeadaanyi sean rat, mida badaydaanyi; aba gideaba niimajeek, aba gideaba marukusiina gil niny aba eaweeda iinya ng'asheesu ikaaschi radiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama nyarja nea gwanuus damanda iinya ng'asheesu; abeeda gayghwasar munyinda gatmoadaanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh deaweedajeega rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, aba dageascheeda ng'eedeeda ea gatmoadaanyi, ea dageascheeda ghweanda ea hudaanyi, aba damanda gheareemaneanduumeadaanyi, aba damanda mideewa gheanyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
